# Weather, forecast, geocoding and air quality use Open-Meteo: NO key required.
#
# Optional — enables map weather layers (temperature / wind / precipitation / clouds).
# NOTE: any VITE_* value is bundled into client code and visible to users. Only use keys
# that are safe to expose (free-tier OpenWeatherMap tile keys), or paste the key into the
# in-app Settings instead. Truly private keys need a serverless proxy (see README).
VITE_OWM_API_KEY=
